~ strange_discovery
do GameDialogueManager.pause_game(true)
#[After defeating the wave37]
Odysseus: Scanning Anomaly.
Player: What is that?
Player: The system detects something.
Odysseus: It’s a cassette tape and a hidden archive.
#[Odysseus plays the tape]
#Unknown Voice:
#	".............................MY DOOM……………."
#[STATIC]
#	
#	"......................IF IT AWAKENS…………"
#[Record Corrupted]
Player: MyDoom?
Odysseus: … never heard of that name.
Player: The hidden archive.
Player: Can we access it?
Odysseus: Yes, but the file appears corrupted.
Player: Can it be recovered?
Odysseus: Maybe, if we can find its missing fragments.
do GameDialogueManager.pause_game(false)
=> END

